From 217f1d8254e68e159d1f026166b7a7e507923408 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 08:01:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 3: per-store Visit page + Store Opening link
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each store now has its own Visit page. locations.publicList() exposes a per-store
storePage (photo, blurb, phone, map); StorePage overlays those + the store's own
name, address and (already per-store) hours over the global store info, so Tulip
Tops shows its own photo/blurb/Sutton address while Mitchell keeps the roastery
page. Stores without their own content fall back to the global page, so single-
site deploys are unchanged.

- The pop-up 'Opening soon' countdown gains a 'Store details' button that opens
  that store's Visit page (photos, info, hours) — the teaser the customer taps
  before the store opens.
- Admin Locations: a 'Visit / store page' editor per store (photo upload, blurb,
  optional phone).
---
 client/src/App.jsx                  |  6 ++++--
 client/src/components/Admin.jsx     | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 client/src/components/StorePage.jsx | 27 ++++++++++++++++++++-------
 server/lib/locations.js             |  8 ++++++++
 4 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

